      "message": "fix(app): a saved .mch keeps the key order it was read in\n\nThe machine draft records each object's key order from the source text\n(machine::order::KeyOrder, a serde visitor) and writes through its own\npretty writer in that order; new keys go last in their object. No new\ndependency, no workspace preserve_order; project files are untouched.\n\nFixes #480\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
