      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/480-mch-key-order\n\nMain gained #478 (Machines pane editor, M-word validation). Its saves\n(Save, Save As, from template) all write MachineDraft::text through\nstore::save_text, so they keep key order. machine_edit.rs conflict kept\nboth sides; the #480 tests move to their own machine_key_order.rs (the\nmerged file passed 400 lines). The #480 decision moves out of #383's\ndecision file into docs/decisions/480-mch-key-order.md; #383's file and\nthe ui snapshot PNGs take main's.\n\nRefs #480\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
